        "created_at": "2014-09-12T14:13:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Cool! I haven't played in a while, stopped somewhere around Spite. But I remember the fight with Miss Information being absolutely brutal, some of her cards deal damage according to H or number of targets, with Silver Gulch hitting you further.</p><p>On the other hand, the Ennead fight was awesome. I think you nailed the right challenge level for a regular team.</p>",
