        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-09-12T15:37:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am glad you liked them. I originally started this so players had something to do while they waited for Vengance to arrive.</p><p>I changed the Miss Information fight. Now, it has an interesting interaction between Miss Info's H value and Nightmist's magic values. It actually makes the new Nightmist promo better than the old one. I agree the challenge you played where you started with a bunch of gunman was probably too hard.</p>",
